  (label "GND" (at 998.22 397.51 270) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 374e5841-6c8a-46a5-ad8c-8ebd3c63a9c1))
  (text "1  Aircraft power in, protection, 5 V buck (LM5164)" (at 23 27 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 12c6d675-df7f-4e47-81c7-492405b67fcf))
  (text "2  USB-C (power + flashing), 3.3 V LDO, filtered rails" (at 433 27 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a9bc7cbb-7418-4260-ac92-a7117c20721b))
  (text "3  ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8" (at 23 187 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4b03c6b1-d5ef-4f1a-bad9-7d27169a0fdd))
  (text "4  DB-15 harness (Gen2 pinout) and line protection" (at 433 187 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0390c5a0-e71a-487d-9ce1-506c882cfc33))
  (text "5  Pressure sensors (Gen2 positions) and ISM330DHCX IMU" (at 23 387 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 06c0de43-b7eb-4cfd-b78a-42933a638816))
  (text "6  Audio: PCM5102A and 600 ohm intercom pad" (at 433 387 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ccc58225-1e84-4af5-9f75-287c5ee7a7e7))
  (text "7  RS-232 (EFIS in/out, GPS in): SP3232E" (at 833 27 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e21b7bb6-e99c-405c-8c25-ebb6b75c8406))
  (text "8  CAN-FiX (MakerPlane): TJA1051T/3, DE-9 male" (at 833 147 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6b237f83-8c42-4147-ab1d-f3e8b5abbe9d))
  (text "9  microSD logging (1-bit SDMMC)" (at 833 267 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ff3ae436-50ca-43d5-9aea-c9e1e390b3ab))
  (text "10  Mechanical: grounded M3 holes, fiducials" (at 833 387 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 830bcbe6-bdfe-404a-8ebc-a007eeddf3a3))
  (text "Order of protection: PTC (over-current) -> SS210 (reverse polarity) -> SMBJ58A (clamps 93.6 V, under the LM5164 100 V rating, so load dump and 28 V surges ride through) -> ferrite + 47 uF damped filter -> LM5164 (100 V rated)." (at 25 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5ac7521a-4e76-44e1-9af2-f9899fac243a))
  (text "USB VBUS feeds +5V through SS14, so the board runs and flashes from a laptop with no aircraft power. With both present the buck (5.0 V) carries the load." (at 435 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 792414f9-a161-4a71-8378-44d8dd19ffb8))
  (text "Strapping: IO0 BOOT button + 10k up; IO3 carries the VIN monitor (strap only used if the JTAG eFuse is set); IO45/IO46 left open (internal pull-downs: 3.3 V flash, normal boot)." (at 25 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b3d98d1a-4c25-4915-b3ff-d78dd91c43c2))
  (text "Every external line has a 15 V bidirectional ESD diode at the connector (flap may see 14 V; audio swings both ways). RS-232 lines rely on the SP3232E's own +/-15 kV protection." (at 435 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b0718096-9365-45f2-adb9-12e1007c43a0))
  (text "Two MS4525DO share address 0x28, so each sits on its own bus (as the firmware expects)." (at 25 565 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b2581343-1cc4-4d3f-93e6-a7d7e64775aa))
  (text "Pad: 2.1 Vrms DAC -> about 0.39 Vrms into a 600 ohm panel input, source impedance about 420 ohm. DAC load stays above 1 kohm. PCM5102A outputs are ground-centred, so no DC blocking is needed." (at 435 565 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7e863327-03f3-4469-a5df-52e4b64be509))
  (text "Unused T2IN tied low so it cannot float." (at 835 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1331da2e-010a-4b8a-934f-5ece4c118a97))
  (text "DE-9: 2 CAN-L, 7 CAN-H, 3 CAN GND, 5 GND, 8 shield; pin 1 bus power not used." (at 835 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 66978a0a-7740-4302-b6be-c17448e3391a))
